description:
Implement `useSpringSequence` that animates an array of values toward their target values using spring physics. Calling `start` begins animating each value; `reset` returns all values to 0; `isRunning` indicates active animation.

**Example:**
```tsx
function Sequence() {
  const { values, start, reset, isRunning } = useSpringSequence(
    [100, 200, 300],
    { stiffness: 200, damping: 20 }
  );

  return (
    <>
      {values.map((v, i) => (
        <div key={i} style={{ transform: `translateX(${v}px)` }} />
      ))}
      <button onClick={start} disabled={isRunning}>Start</button>
      <button onClick={reset}>Reset</button>
    </>
  );
}
```

